WEBVTT

00:00:07.910 --> 00:00:12.790
A grimoire is the accumulation of human wisdom.

00:00:12.790 --> 00:00:15.410
Just reading it eats away at a human's sanity,

00:00:15.410 --> 00:00:19.240
but in exchange, it imparts
knowledge of various magics.

00:00:19.240 --> 00:00:24.740
For that reason, demons greatly feared and
sealed grimoires away in the Demon Castle.

00:00:24.740 --> 00:00:26.240
Grimoire?

00:00:26.240 --> 00:00:33.290
And the captured princess realized that the
grimoire was most likely a very difficult book.

00:00:33.290 --> 00:00:35.330
Which meant that...

00:00:35.330 --> 00:00:40.040
...she'd sleep well if she read it at bedtime.

00:00:36.890 --> 00:00:40.040
Demon Castle Underground Library

00:00:40.290 --> 00:00:42.160
Patrolling sucks.

00:00:42.020 --> 00:00:48.030
Bigwig Penguin

00:00:42.020 --> 00:00:48.030
Jester Soldier

00:00:42.160 --> 00:00:43.620
We've gotta do it.

00:00:43.620 --> 00:00:46.080
If the Forbidden Grimoire's seal is broken,

00:00:46.080 --> 00:00:48.450
even the demon king will be in trouble.

00:00:48.450 --> 00:00:53.160
But aren't the only ones who can break
the seal the demon king or chosen humans?

00:00:53.160 --> 00:00:55.490
No way they're getting down here.

00:00:55.490 --> 00:00:57.160
Yeah, you've got that right.

00:01:02.040 --> 00:01:05.290
"Quest"
"Book to Induce Sleep"

00:01:06.540 --> 00:01:09.790
Grimoires are super boring.

00:02:41.120 --> 00:02:46.040
"Third Night"
"The Princess and Forbidden Knowledge"

00:02:46.540 --> 00:02:48.120
It's so boring.

00:02:49.830 --> 00:02:52.910
Wait, it's supposed to be boring.

00:02:52.910 --> 00:02:58.830
I slipped past the guard to get this
pile of grimoires to help me sleep.

00:02:58.830 --> 00:03:01.740
I'm looking for a book for my back pain.

00:03:01.740 --> 00:03:03.290
Okay! Go right ahead!

00:03:01.790 --> 00:03:03.540
Easygoing Guard

00:03:05.620 --> 00:03:10.740
But it's strange... I've read several volumes
already and instead of getting sleepy,

00:03:10.740 --> 00:03:15.580
I feel like something else is getting depleted.

00:03:15.580 --> 00:03:18.040
Is it because this is a beginner's grimoire?

00:03:18.040 --> 00:03:21.950
I might find intermediate or advanced
ones if I go farther down.

00:03:24.540 --> 00:03:25.620
I can't get up.

00:03:29.580 --> 00:03:30.700
What should I do?

00:03:33.830 --> 00:03:38.910
But what if the captured princess
is one of the chosen ones?

00:03:38.910 --> 00:03:40.540
We'd be in trouble.

00:03:40.540 --> 00:03:42.950
Don't worry about that!

00:03:42.950 --> 00:03:45.080
Oh, this is effortless.

00:03:45.080 --> 00:03:49.240
There's actually a special procedure needed

00:03:49.240 --> 00:03:52.080
to break the most dangerous
Forbidden Grimoire's seal.

00:03:52.080 --> 00:03:54.200
Oh, no. I'm speeding up.

00:03:54.200 --> 00:03:57.870
First, you've gotta push all
the switches going down the stairs.

00:03:57.870 --> 00:03:59.950
Then destroy all the charms.

00:04:09.910 --> 00:04:14.830
On top of that, you've gotta get all the statues
at the entrance to face each other.

00:04:14.830 --> 00:04:17.080
Nobody can break the seal otherwise.

00:04:27.450 --> 00:04:30.290
Huh? I'm alive.

00:04:32.620 --> 00:04:34.200
That's...

00:04:34.200 --> 00:04:36.330
Looks like a pretty powerful grimoire.

00:04:36.330 --> 00:04:37.720
Forbidden Grimoire

00:04:37.910 --> 00:04:41.790
I'm sure I'd be dead asleep
in no time if I read it.

00:04:47.910 --> 00:04:50.040
First time I've woken in centuries!

00:04:52.830 --> 00:04:55.740
You have my gratitude, chosen one!

00:04:55.740 --> 00:04:58.080
My name's Alazif!

00:04:56.610 --> 00:05:01.740
Alazif, Spirit of the Grimoire

00:04:58.080 --> 00:05:02.080
Oh, a royal princess! My duty is to serve!

00:05:02.080 --> 00:05:06.200
Now, use me immediately to destroy the demons!

00:05:06.200 --> 00:05:08.290
Then you can escape the Demon Castle!

00:05:11.240 --> 00:05:14.120
This book won't help me sleep.

00:05:14.120 --> 00:05:16.080
S-Stop! Wait! Hold on!

00:05:16.080 --> 00:05:18.870
I can do all sorts of things! I'm very useful!

00:05:21.160 --> 00:05:24.080
Then bring me a cup of healing
potion mixed with a soft drink

00:05:24.080 --> 00:05:26.580
and the latest issue of <i>Shonen Sunday</i> .

00:05:26.580 --> 00:05:28.660
This isn't a manga cafe!

00:05:28.660 --> 00:05:31.370
I'm starting to feel like reading
something more fun.

00:05:31.370 --> 00:05:35.450
Uh, well, I will restore your MP.

00:05:35.450 --> 00:05:39.200
Are you sure about this?
I can teach you great magic!

00:05:39.200 --> 00:05:40.290
No thanks.

00:05:40.290 --> 00:05:45.370
Um, I am a powerful grimoire.
You can use me to destroy--

00:05:45.370 --> 00:05:46.580
No thanks.

00:05:46.580 --> 00:05:47.950
--Demons--
--No thanks.

00:05:47.950 --> 00:05:49.240
--De--
--No thanks.

00:05:50.790 --> 00:05:53.160
If you do not wish to destroy the demons,

00:05:53.160 --> 00:05:56.790
I know magic that can incapacitate
the whole Demon Castle.

00:05:59.740 --> 00:06:04.290
Does that include sleep magic?

00:06:06.950 --> 00:06:07.950
Pardon me.

00:06:09.370 --> 00:06:13.620
Demon King, we've installed Show the Mary
units at the castle perimeter

00:06:13.620 --> 00:06:15.120
to increase security.

00:06:15.120 --> 00:06:17.580
Will you take a look?

00:06:17.580 --> 00:06:19.040
Yes. Put it on.

00:06:22.120 --> 00:06:24.200
Nightshift tonight, huh?

00:06:24.200 --> 00:06:25.950
Man, I'm sleepy.

00:06:25.950 --> 00:06:28.160
Quit complaining.

00:06:28.160 --> 00:06:30.910
They say the walls have ears
and the doors have eyes!

00:06:31.700 --> 00:06:33.330
Show the Mary

00:06:34.290 --> 00:06:36.830
No problems, it seems.

00:06:36.830 --> 00:06:37.830
Yeah...

00:06:41.120 --> 00:06:43.830
Oh, so this is sleep magic?

00:06:43.830 --> 00:06:44.910
It is!

00:06:46.290 --> 00:06:48.790
I feel as if I could do magic now.

00:06:48.790 --> 00:06:50.910
Because I taught you!

00:06:50.910 --> 00:06:55.830
But hear me out. This magic uses
an enormous amount of MP.

00:06:55.830 --> 00:06:57.660
--Use it just once--
--Let's try this.

00:07:04.910 --> 00:07:09.950
At that moment, great drowsiness
enveloped the Demon Castle.

00:07:12.540 --> 00:07:16.080
Even the demon king could not resist the magic.

00:07:27.040 --> 00:07:28.450
Zzz...

00:07:43.910 --> 00:07:46.910
The Demon Castle fell into slumber.

00:07:48.620 --> 00:07:52.160
Except for the conjurer, the princess.

00:07:59.120 --> 00:08:00.660
What about me?

00:08:00.660 --> 00:08:02.540
Princess! Now's your chance!

00:08:02.540 --> 00:08:05.620
Take me and escape from the Demon Castle!

00:08:05.620 --> 00:08:07.870
I don't get to sleep?

00:08:07.870 --> 00:08:10.160
Huh? Oh, come on!

00:08:10.160 --> 00:08:14.450
There's no point if the magic
affects the conjurer!

00:08:14.450 --> 00:08:16.790
All adventurers know <i>that</i> --

00:08:19.160 --> 00:08:20.240
Princess!

00:08:25.450 --> 00:08:26.580
No fair.

00:08:26.580 --> 00:08:29.410
Huh? Wh-What's wrong, Princess?

00:08:29.410 --> 00:08:31.870
Have you decided to escape? Then--

00:08:31.870 --> 00:08:32.910
It's not fair.

00:08:32.910 --> 00:08:33.950
Huh?

00:08:33.950 --> 00:08:36.370
It's not fair that everyone else is asleep.

00:08:36.370 --> 00:08:37.790
I'm sleeping, too!

00:08:37.790 --> 00:08:41.240
Huh? Uh, Princess, what are you
doing with that grimoire?

00:08:55.120 --> 00:08:56.240
Zzz...

00:08:57.240 --> 00:09:05.580
Quest Complete

00:09:01.700 --> 00:09:05.580
"Used it as a pillow"

00:09:02.600 --> 00:09:05.580
Used it as a pillow!

00:09:06.290 --> 00:09:09.240
What was the point of casting sleep magic...

00:09:10.290 --> 00:09:14.580
They say that the Demon Castle
was quiet for three days.

00:09:19.540 --> 00:09:21.990
Special skill! Walking on my hands!

00:09:21.990 --> 00:09:24.740
It's amazing, but also amazingly annoying.

00:09:25.040 --> 00:09:30.050
"Alazif"
"Wisdom: Unmeasurable"
"Utility: ☆☆☆☆☆☆☆☆☆☆"

00:09:26.160 --> 00:09:27.870
<i>Sleepy Princess in the Demon Castle</i> .

00:09:31.200 --> 00:09:37.080
The physical body. More mysterious
than any dungeon or magic.

00:09:41.660 --> 00:09:43.950
For instance, dragons have weak points,

00:09:43.950 --> 00:09:45.080
It's super effective!

00:09:45.200 --> 00:09:46.990
demons have vital points,

00:09:47.830 --> 00:09:48.830
<i>Critical hit!</i>

00:09:49.290 --> 00:09:51.580
and humans have...

00:09:54.450 --> 00:09:55.950
...pressure points!

00:09:58.200 --> 00:09:59.330
<i>Critical hit!</i>

00:10:00.950 --> 00:10:04.120
Th-That was the pressure point
for fatigue recovery.

00:10:04.960 --> 00:10:09.210
A few days ago

00:10:04.960 --> 00:10:09.210
Demon Castle
Underground Library

00:10:06.790 --> 00:10:11.330
Grimoire, I don't need magic.
Give me a book on medicine.

00:10:11.330 --> 00:10:13.080
I want to sleep better.

00:10:14.870 --> 00:10:17.240
That's how I came across pressure points.

00:10:17.240 --> 00:10:18.600
Bladder
Meridian 17

00:10:18.870 --> 00:10:22.120
There are multiple pressure points
for insomnia and better sleep.

00:10:22.120 --> 00:10:25.580
All of those were effective for me.

00:10:25.580 --> 00:10:27.200
But...

00:10:27.200 --> 00:10:30.160
...this one pressure point I can't push myself!

00:10:31.950 --> 00:10:35.740
I just know this pressure point
will put me fast asleep!

00:10:36.240 --> 00:10:39.370
Getting hopes up without reason

00:10:39.370 --> 00:10:43.120
"Quest"
"Have Someone Push Pressure Points to Sleep"

00:10:43.330 --> 00:10:44.990
Got it? Right here.

00:10:47.830 --> 00:10:50.410
Quickly solved this time.

00:10:50.410 --> 00:10:53.950
I'll be going "zzz" before long.

00:10:53.950 --> 00:10:55.040
Go on.

00:11:03.330 --> 00:11:04.410
Are you pushing?

00:11:11.620 --> 00:11:13.450
I will go on a journey.

00:11:13.450 --> 00:11:17.540
A journey to find someone
to push my pressure points!

00:11:17.540 --> 00:11:20.830
Guess what?
I dreamt that I slept for three days!

00:11:20.830 --> 00:11:26.200
I woke up starvin' and devoured a hundred bowls
of steamed bird beast egg custards!

00:11:26.200 --> 00:11:29.120
Dude, you trying to kill yourself?
That's not a balanced meal.

00:11:31.290 --> 00:11:33.120
You there.

00:11:33.120 --> 00:11:35.120
The princess?! She's escaped again!

00:11:35.120 --> 00:11:36.540
And she's talking to us!

00:11:38.120 --> 00:11:40.450
Come on, Princess.
You can't just let yourself out.

00:11:40.450 --> 00:11:44.740
Yeah. Actually, I have these
sleep pressure points--

00:11:44.740 --> 00:11:48.990
Oh, yeah, that guy warned me the other day...

00:11:48.990 --> 00:11:55.290
I'm reinspecting your room the next time your
sleep shenanigans cause a commotion!

00:11:55.290 --> 00:12:00.490
It'll be a bother if I give out too many
details, so I'll keep it vague.

00:12:00.490 --> 00:12:06.790
I need someone to push my pressure points

00:12:01.790 --> 00:12:07.080
I should try to leave out the bit
about pressure points.

00:12:07.080 --> 00:12:08.620
Got it.

00:12:08.620 --> 00:12:11.160
I need someone to touch my body.

00:12:11.160 --> 00:12:12.160
What?!

00:12:17.040 --> 00:12:20.200
Hm? They don't understand.

00:12:20.200 --> 00:12:22.200
If someone pushes my pressure points,

00:12:22.200 --> 00:12:25.410
I'll fall asleep in an instant,
so please touch me in my room.

00:12:27.580 --> 00:12:28.910
Oh, I can--

00:12:28.910 --> 00:12:30.910
That's suicide!

00:12:39.160 --> 00:12:44.830
Oh, now that I think about it,
those demons all have peculiar fingers.

00:12:44.830 --> 00:12:47.370
That's why they held back.

00:12:47.370 --> 00:12:48.450
If that's the case...

00:12:50.490 --> 00:12:53.120
Hello, Princess. I'm not giving coffins--

00:12:53.120 --> 00:12:55.950
I'd like you to touch my body in my bedroom.

00:13:01.830 --> 00:13:06.660
I-I don't think that would be wise.

00:13:06.660 --> 00:13:08.870
He pulled himself together.

00:13:08.870 --> 00:13:13.910
Why not? Your fingers are just right.

00:13:17.790 --> 00:13:20.240
Demon Cleric!

00:13:22.040 --> 00:13:25.240
His advanced age couldn't keep up
with the sudden turn of events!

00:13:25.240 --> 00:13:26.540
Use a potion!

00:13:26.540 --> 00:13:29.450
Hang in there, Demon Cleric!

00:13:26.540 --> 00:13:29.450
Why did he faint?

00:13:29.450 --> 00:13:30.790
Anyway, I'll flee.

00:13:33.410 --> 00:13:35.120
Leaves me no choice.

00:13:35.120 --> 00:13:41.330
Next time, I'll drag a demon with
more spine to my bedroom by force.

00:13:41.330 --> 00:13:44.870
But where to find such a demon?

00:13:44.870 --> 00:13:48.580
H-Huh? Princess?!

00:13:48.580 --> 00:13:49.830
You're awake?!

00:13:52.950 --> 00:13:57.240
I must show my dignity as the demon king!

00:13:57.240 --> 00:13:59.790
I am Twilight the Demon King!

00:13:58.040 --> 00:14:02.280
Castle's Boss

00:13:59.790 --> 00:14:04.200
Captured princess,
why are you out of your cell?!

00:14:04.200 --> 00:14:05.160
Found one.

00:14:05.160 --> 00:14:06.410
Ordinary hand

00:14:07.410 --> 00:14:08.990
Come.

00:14:08.990 --> 00:14:10.080
Come on.

00:14:12.990 --> 00:14:17.870
Er, do you... need something?

00:14:17.870 --> 00:14:20.160
Why did she bring me to her cell?

00:14:20.160 --> 00:14:24.330
Not to mention this is my
first time talking to her!

00:14:24.330 --> 00:14:26.870
And why does she sit on her bed?

00:14:26.870 --> 00:14:31.330
You... Don't say a word and push here.

00:14:31.330 --> 00:14:32.910
What?!

00:14:32.910 --> 00:14:34.830
That's a human back!

00:14:34.830 --> 00:14:37.950
Could-- Could it be?! Is this an invitation?!

00:14:38.490 --> 00:14:41.200
All You Need to Know About Human Ecology!

00:14:38.490 --> 00:14:41.200
In a text I've read, it said,

00:14:41.200 --> 00:14:44.620
"After you push, just go for it."

00:14:44.620 --> 00:14:48.580
Is it true?! I should just
go for it after I push?!

00:14:48.580 --> 00:14:49.620
Hurry up.

00:14:51.370 --> 00:14:53.160
All right, here goes!

00:14:53.160 --> 00:14:55.700
Princess!

00:14:55.700 --> 00:14:57.200
Go for it after I push!

00:15:04.620 --> 00:15:07.450
Stare.

00:15:07.450 --> 00:15:10.910
Getting pressure points pushed is great.

00:15:10.910 --> 00:15:12.200
Zzz...

00:15:12.850 --> 00:15:20.490
Quest Complete

00:15:17.370 --> 00:15:20.490
"Good job"

00:15:18.060 --> 00:15:20.490
Good job!

00:15:20.990 --> 00:15:22.740
All for <i>that</i> again!

00:15:23.870 --> 00:15:25.990
Gently pulls up covers

00:15:30.990 --> 00:15:33.990
<i>Can't handle those pure eyes!</i>

00:15:33.990 --> 00:15:39.000
"Demon Cleric"
"SAN Check: ---"
"Distress: ☆☆☆☆☆☆☆☆☆"

00:15:35.330 --> 00:15:36.870
<i>Sleepy Princess in the Demon Castle</i> .

00:15:40.620 --> 00:15:42.290
Sunlight.

00:15:42.290 --> 00:15:49.830
For humans, it is a necessary element
in order to wake feeling refreshed.

00:15:49.830 --> 00:15:54.410
However, the Demon Castle,
where the princess is imprisoned,

00:15:54.410 --> 00:15:57.040
has been encompassed in
eternal night since ancient times.

00:16:00.580 --> 00:16:03.370
I need sunlight.

00:16:04.540 --> 00:16:09.950
I never knew the importance
of sunlight before coming here.

00:16:09.950 --> 00:16:16.120
My internal clock, which is regulated
by sunlight, is messed up.

00:16:16.120 --> 00:16:19.200
So no matter what,
I don't feel refreshed when I wake,

00:16:19.200 --> 00:16:22.290
and then I feel lethargic all day.

00:16:22.290 --> 00:16:27.290
I wish I could wake in light, even if it's
only as bright as that part of the forest.

00:16:28.050 --> 00:16:31.430
"Quest"
"Wake in the Light"

00:16:31.870 --> 00:16:36.450
But I can't go beyond the Demon Castle's walls.

00:16:42.620 --> 00:16:45.290
On second thought, maybe I can.

00:16:45.830 --> 00:16:51.700
<i>New map area added</i>

00:16:47.950 --> 00:16:51.700
<i>Demon Castle</i>

00:16:47.950 --> 00:16:51.700
<i>Outer Demon Castle:
 Forest of Sacred Treasure</i>

00:16:59.740 --> 00:17:02.450
The princess is carrying a lot today.

00:17:02.450 --> 00:17:06.120
But seriously, why does she keep
escaping from her cell?!

00:17:06.120 --> 00:17:10.830
Chill out. She can't escape
from the Demon Castle itself.

00:17:10.830 --> 00:17:15.040
Even if she were to try, there's the magma moat.

00:17:15.040 --> 00:17:18.160
Plus, a giant maze.

00:17:18.160 --> 00:17:20.290
And a cliff!

00:17:23.700 --> 00:17:25.080
Forest of Sacred Treasure

00:17:25.200 --> 00:17:27.830
That's true. It'd be impossible.

00:17:29.490 --> 00:17:32.660
Alert! The princess has escaped
the Demon Castle!

00:17:32.660 --> 00:17:35.700
Repeat! The princess has escaped
the Demon Castle!

00:17:35.700 --> 00:17:37.290
Capture her immediately!

00:17:37.290 --> 00:17:38.370
What?!

00:17:38.370 --> 00:17:40.330
She actually escaped!

00:17:41.580 --> 00:17:42.990
--What?!
--The princess <i>again</i> ?

00:17:42.990 --> 00:17:44.450
--Shoot.
--She escaped?

00:17:44.450 --> 00:17:46.410
Was the alert real?

00:17:46.410 --> 00:17:48.990
Humans shouldn't be able
to escape under normal conditions!

00:17:51.330 --> 00:17:54.700
She seems to have wandered into
the Forest of Sacred Treasure.

00:17:54.700 --> 00:17:56.040
I'll put it through.

00:17:56.040 --> 00:17:57.040
Good.

00:17:59.080 --> 00:18:01.490
She really is outside.

00:18:01.490 --> 00:18:02.950
She just smiled!

00:18:02.950 --> 00:18:10.620
I thought the whole forest was lit up,
but it's clearly brighter deeper within!

00:18:10.620 --> 00:18:14.040
Which means that the light must have a source.

00:18:16.450 --> 00:18:19.990
I'm feeling brighter.

00:18:19.990 --> 00:18:22.240
I will make sure to obtain it.

00:18:24.370 --> 00:18:26.120
Natural High

00:18:28.160 --> 00:18:32.120
Yikes, that's not the look of a happy runaway!

00:18:32.120 --> 00:18:35.450
Don't be a wuss! She's a hostage princess!

00:18:35.450 --> 00:18:39.450
But why is the princess heading
deeper into the forest?

00:18:39.450 --> 00:18:42.490
Demon King, do you have an idea why?

00:18:42.490 --> 00:18:44.870
Demon King?!

00:18:44.870 --> 00:18:47.370
I put my ultimate weapon there.

00:18:47.370 --> 00:18:48.660
What?

00:18:48.660 --> 00:18:53.620
I put my ultimate weapon deep within the forest.

00:18:53.620 --> 00:18:57.200
What sort of weapon?

00:18:57.200 --> 00:19:01.240
A shining sword with jagged edges.

00:19:01.240 --> 00:19:03.580
It's stuck in a foundation on the ground.

00:19:05.490 --> 00:19:06.620
She stopped!

00:19:13.200 --> 00:19:14.950
There it is!

00:19:13.630 --> 00:19:15.880
Hidden Item

00:19:13.630 --> 00:19:15.880
Sacred Sword of Valor

00:19:16.200 --> 00:19:20.950
What is this? It shines like the sun.

00:19:20.950 --> 00:19:27.240
This will work.
This light will reset my internal clock!

00:19:29.990 --> 00:19:31.160
How blinding!

00:19:32.490 --> 00:19:35.290
What the heck is she going to do?!

00:19:35.290 --> 00:19:38.410
Is she planning to take it
and rendezvous with the hero?!

00:19:38.410 --> 00:19:41.700
What will happen to the Demon Castle then?!

00:19:41.700 --> 00:19:45.490
A-All personnel!
Bring the princess back at all costs!

00:19:47.540 --> 00:19:48.660
Listen up!

00:19:48.660 --> 00:19:52.120
The princess will try to gain as much distance
from the Demon Castle as she can!

00:19:52.120 --> 00:19:56.040
Which means that she will proceed
deeper into the forest!

00:19:56.040 --> 00:19:59.080
The princess is probably
hiding in the trees, quietly--

00:20:09.330 --> 00:20:12.160
Isn't the Demon Castle that way?

00:20:12.160 --> 00:20:14.790
Huh? She's going back?

00:20:14.790 --> 00:20:16.290
She's going back.

00:20:16.290 --> 00:20:17.700
No way.

00:20:17.700 --> 00:20:21.620
Come on, why'd she return
to the Demon Castle willingly?

00:20:23.740 --> 00:20:25.330
She really did.

00:20:26.450 --> 00:20:30.660
I've obtained a superb light!

00:20:30.660 --> 00:20:34.200
Now I'll tie it to the iron railing like this,

00:20:34.200 --> 00:20:35.330
String made of Teddy Demons

00:20:35.660 --> 00:20:37.830
cover it will multiple layers of cloth,

00:20:37.830 --> 00:20:38.840
Ghost Shroud bodies

00:20:39.240 --> 00:20:40.740
and flip it!

00:20:41.830 --> 00:20:45.870
Just like sunlight streaming through a window!

00:20:45.870 --> 00:20:55.120
And later, the magnificent sunshine
will rouse me from sleep.

00:20:56.830 --> 00:20:58.450
Zzz...

00:21:09.660 --> 00:21:13.990
What do you think, Demon King?
Is the princess arming up?

00:21:13.990 --> 00:21:16.660
No... how should I put it?

00:21:18.040 --> 00:21:19.910
I'm awake!

00:21:20.300 --> 00:21:27.770
Quest Complete

00:21:24.760 --> 00:21:27.770
"Excellent job"

00:21:26.010 --> 00:21:27.790
Excellent job!

00:21:28.790 --> 00:21:31.370
I never imagined it would be used that way.

00:23:07.040 --> 00:23:08.740
I know I'm just making excuses,

00:23:08.740 --> 00:23:12.580
but the Forest of Sacred Treasure
is a hidden dungeon,

00:23:12.580 --> 00:23:15.330
and the Sword of Valor is a hidden item.

00:23:15.330 --> 00:23:18.370
This shouldn't have a direct
effect on the hero's journey.

00:23:21.830 --> 00:23:26.080
But the princess is well. Should I say <i>too</i> well?

00:23:26.080 --> 00:23:32.330
I'd like to complain to the hero saying,
"Your princess is truly well."

00:23:32.330 --> 00:23:34.740
However, I will not be discouraged.

00:23:34.740 --> 00:23:37.910
That's one of my strong points.
I... am--

00:23:37.910 --> 00:23:42.030
The rest is torn off

00:23:38.910 --> 00:23:39.910
Hm?

00:23:42.740 --> 00:23:44.950
Who was it that once said

00:23:44.950 --> 00:23:49.330
that there's nothing more fun
than to sleep in a warm bed?

00:23:49.330 --> 00:23:51.700
I feel like we would get along.

00:23:51.700 --> 00:23:55.080
Next time, "The Princess,
Destruction, and a Short Journey."

00:23:55.080 --> 00:23:56.450
<i>Sleepy Princess in the Demon Castle</i> .
